    "sentence_translations": [
      "I Like Teachers’ Day",
      "",
      "My mom is a teacher. Today is her festival. Every Teachers’ Day, Mom is very happy.",
      "Mom’s students will give her flowers to wish her a happy festival.",
      "After work, Mom will take me to eat good food. On this day, food at the restaurants is very cheap.",
      "Sometimes, Mom will also take me out to have fun. On this day, tickets are very cheap.",
      "Everyone hopes that Teachers’ Day can be joyful. I like this day!"
